FRU data files from the tests of frugy, the FRU generator of the MicroTCA
Technology Lab at DESY: https://github.com/MicroTCA-Tech-Lab/frugy
(tests/bin_files). They are distributed under the BSD-3-Clause license
of frugy, see LICENSE.txt.

opalkelly_default.bin and opalkelly_default_2k.bin are the default FRU
data of Opal Kelly boards. They do not conform to the IPMI FRU
specification: the multirecords have no end of list flag and the list
ends with records with wrong checksums.
